e usage meant in an example such as palm stearin.","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Stearin"}},"photo":{"file":"Stearin krystalický.JPG","thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3c/Stearin_krystalick%C3%BD.JPG/960px-Stearin_krystalick%C3%BD.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","width":640,"height":480,"page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Stearin_krystalick%C3%BD.JPG","author":"Dendrofil","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","kind":"photo"},"synced":"2026-11-01"}
